        "text": "Security update for epiphany",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for epiphany fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in epiphany:\n\n- CVE-2026-118598: clipboard/website-data permission prompt\n  incorrectly grants camera and microphone access (bsc#1288945)\n- CVE-2026-118599: TAR-based`.xpi` with hard links can overwrite\n  user files during `WebExtension` install (bsc#1288946)\n- CVE-2026-77679: path traversal in WebExtension XPI extraction\n  (ZIP slip) (bsc#1276758)\n- CVE-2026-77682: JavaScript code injection in autofill via\n  unsanitized CSS selector from element id (bsc#1275932)\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
